ng that any of it will finally get them their dream job.

But there's one problem, *Abdul*.

*A certificate can prove that you completed something.*
*It cannot prove that you can actually do it.*

You can have a degree in Cybersecurity.
You can have multiple certifications.
You can have =E2=80=9CEthical Hacker=E2=80=9D written on your resume.

But when someone gives you a real system and asks:
